{"abstract":"Diversity and Inclusion (D&I) are core to fostering innovative thinking. Existing theories demonstrate that to facilitate inclusion, multiple types of exclusionary dynamics, such as self-segregation, communication apprehension, and stereotyping and stigmatizing, must be overcome [11]. A diverse group of people tends to surface different perspectives, which help to understand and address D&I. Fostering D&I in research communities must address issues related to inclusive interpersonal and small group dynamics, rules and codes of conduct, increasing diversity in under-represented groups and disciplines, and organizing D&I events, and longterm efforts to champion change.","author_count":33,"contributors":["Amer-Yahia, Sihem","Amsterdamer, Yael","Bhowmick, Sourav S.","Bonifati, Angela","Bonnet, Philippe","Borovica-Gajic, Renata","Catania, Barbara","Cerquitelli, Tania","Chiusano, Silvia","Chrysanthis, Panos K.","Curino, Carlo","Darmont, Jérôme","Abbadi, Amr El","Floratou, Avrilia","Freire, Juliana","Jindal, Alekh","Kalogeraki, Vana","Koutrika, Georgia","Kumar, Arun","Maiyya, Sujaya","Meliou, Alexandra","Mohanty, Madhulika","Naumann, Felix","Noack, Nele Sina","Özcan, Fatma","Peterfreund, Liat","Rahayu, Wenny","Tan, Wang-Chiew","Tian, Yuanyuan","Tözün, Pinar","Vargas-Solar, Genoveva","Yadwadkar, Neeraja J.","Zhang, Meihui"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384708"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Asia, Middle East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","China","France","Germany","Greece","Israel","Italy","Singapore","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Athena Research and Innovation Center in Information, Communication and Knowledge Technologies","Athens University of Economics and Business","Bar-Ilan University","Beijing Institute of Technology","CERSA/CNRS France","Google Inc.","Hasso Plattner Institute",